cmaps.bin and unicode.bin are generated by scripts/gen_cmaps.py from the CMap data shipped
in pdfminer.six 20260107 (pdfminer/cmap/*.json.gz; pdfminer.six is MIT-licensed). pdfminer
builds those files from the Adobe CMap resources (cid2code tables for Adobe-CNS1, -GB1,
-Japan1 and -Korea1, https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/cmap-resources), which Adobe
publishes under the BSD-3-Clause licence.
